  -  Requires in ossec.conf:
  -    <ruleset>
  -      <decoder_exclude>ruleset/decoders/0295-sonicwall_decoders.xml</decoder_exclude>
  -    </ruleset>
  -
  -  The upstream parent hands parsing to the compiled SonicWall_Decoder, which
  -  is terminal: no child of that parent is ever evaluated, including
  -  upstream's own sonicwall-fields blocks. Adding children cannot work.
  -
  -  Section 1 reproduces the seven static fields the plugin emitted, so rules
  -  4800 to 4899 keep firing. status comes from pri and is what 4801 keys on.
